{
 "id": "5444f8c7-aca8-4eba-9414-0e1cfeb176c6",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Iranai Akuyaku Reijou, Waga Kuni de Hikitorimasu wa Yuushuu na Go-reijoukata o Tsuihou da Nante Orokana Mane, Kuni o Horoboshimashite yo?"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "要らない悪役令嬢、我が国で引き取りますわ　優秀なご令嬢方を追放だなんて愚かな真似、国を滅ぼしましてよ？"
   },
   {
    "en": "Our Country Takes in Unwanted Villainesses. Banishing All These Excellent Noble Girls Is an Act of Foolishness That Will Ruin Their Countries, You Know?"
   },
   {
    "en": "We’ll Take the Unwanted Villainesses, and We'll Take Them Back to Our Own Country."
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "I was reincarnated as the Princess of a small, insignificant country only referred to as the Struntz Kindom.\n\nI, Brünhilde Rosenmüler Stuckenschmidt (yes I am aware my name is quite the mouthful), am the future Queen of my country. My Nation is surrounded by four other countries.\n\nEven though it's a small country, it's quite okay. All of those foolish surrounding nations have the tendency to banish their people who happen to have extraordinary talents with abilities so amazing that they are almost cheat-level skills.\n\nThus begins the story of a reincarnated princess who aims to gather all of those banished \"villainesses\" and other villainous ladies into her Kingdom so that her small nation becomes the most powerfull and prosperous one of all!",
   "ja": "私が転生したのは、ただ「隣国」と語られる モブのための小国の王女だった。\n\n周囲を4つの国に囲まれたシュトルンツ国の 次期女王ブリュンヒルト・ローゼンミュラー・シュトゥッケンシュミット。舌を噛みそうな名前のモブ王女。\n\nモブの小国だけども、大丈夫。周囲の国は、才能あふれるチート級の人間を 追放してくれるのだから。\n\n周囲の国々で追放される悪女や悪役令嬢を集めて、国を繁栄させたい転生王女の物語、開幕！"
  },
